          "title": "Mix dry ingredients",
          "description": "Transfer the ground oats to a bowl. Add baking powder and salt, then stir to combine."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "add-wet-ingredients-oatmeal-waffles",
        "en": {
          "title": "Add wet ingredients",
          "description": "Pour in 1 tablespoon of sunflower oil, the milk, and the honey. Mix everything thoroughly."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "separate-eggs-add-yolks-oatmeal-waffles",
        "en": {
          "title": "Separate eggs and add yolks",
          "description": "Separate the egg yolks from the whites. Add the yolks to the batter and mix well."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "whip-egg-whites-oatmeal-waffles",
        "en": {
          "title": "Whip the egg whites",
          "description": "In a separate clean, dry bowl, whip the egg whites with a mixer until stiff peaks form."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fold-egg-whites-oatmeal-waffles",
        "en": {
          "title": "Fold in the egg whites",
          "description": "Gradually add the whipped egg whites to the batter in small portions, gently folding with a motion from bottom to top until combined."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "preheat-waffle-iron-oatmeal-waffles",
        "en": {
          "title": "Preheat the waffle iron",
          "description": "Preheat your electric waffle iron and lightly grease the surface with the remaining oil."
        }
      },
      {
